WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.752
- [Wendy] It's like my world is washed out,

00:00:04.752 --> 00:00:08.497
and I see fewer shades of
color than most people do.

00:00:08.497 --> 00:00:10.886
- [Maureen] So normal
people see a million colors

00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:13.901
I may see as many as 100,000,000.

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:15.235
(bell music)

00:00:15.235 --> 00:00:17.416
- [Wendy] My name is
Wendy; I'm a producer at CNN,

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:19.395
and I'm colorblind.

00:00:19.395 --> 00:00:22.591
- [Maureen] My name is Maureen
Seaberg; I'm a tetrachromat;

00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:24.123
and I'm an author.

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:29.027
Tetrachromacy is the presence
of a fourth cone class

00:00:29.027 --> 00:00:30.277
in your retina.

00:00:32.027 --> 00:00:34.628
If I keep naming my invisible colors

00:00:34.628 --> 00:00:38.271
maybe I'll have my own
Crayola box one day (laughs).

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:39.747
- [Wendy] When I was in Kindergarten

00:00:39.747 --> 00:00:41.679
my teacher called my parents

00:00:41.679 --> 00:00:44.385
because I was coloring
the leaves of my trees

00:00:44.385 --> 00:00:47.209
and the trunks of my trees the same color.

00:00:47.209 --> 00:00:49.411
Because I couldn't
really see the difference

00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:50.997
between green and brown.

00:00:50.997 --> 00:00:53.072
- [Maureen] The only time
it was ever overwhelming

00:00:53.072 --> 00:00:56.098
is a paint contractor came to my house

00:00:56.098 --> 00:01:00.357
and brought no fewer than 32
samples before I was satisfied

00:01:00.357 --> 00:01:02.739
that it was a true beige.

00:01:02.739 --> 00:01:07.238
- [Wendy] When I pick
out clothes, that's hard,

00:01:07.238 --> 00:01:09.342
I have been known to buy the outfit

00:01:09.342 --> 00:01:10.774
that the mannequin is wearing

00:01:10.774 --> 00:01:12.570
because I know that that goes together.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.509
- [Maureen] You don't want to
go clothing shopping with me

00:01:14.509 --> 00:01:18.731
because the sales people
tell me, but it matches

00:01:18.731 --> 00:01:21.130
and I can only look at
them sympathetically

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:22.918
and keep looking.

00:01:22.918 --> 00:01:26.026
- [Wendy] I never think like,
oh, if I weren't colorblind

00:01:26.026 --> 00:01:28.150
it would be so much easier
to get dressed in the morning.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:30.522
It's just, it's kind of part of me.

00:01:30.522 --> 00:01:34.689
- [Maureen] I guess I'm a
unicorn or something. (laughs)

